<title>USA: Corning redeeming 7.75 pct debentures.</title>
<headline>Corning redeeming 7.75 pct debentures.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc said Friday it will redeem on June 15 its outstanding 7.75 percent sinking fund debentures due Nov 15, 1998.</p>
<p>The debt will be bought back at par plus accrued interest from May 15 to June 15, which totals $6.4583333 per $1,000 face amount.</p>
